<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Automating the Bloodlust Skill in Rise Online</Major>
    <Description>Purpose of a Bloodlust Automation Macro

The primary objective of a Bloodlust macro is to:

Ensure Bloodlust is activated immediately after its cooldown ends

Prevent downtime where the buff is inactive

Reduce the need for constant manual monitoring during combat

From a gameplay perspective, this leads to more stable damage output and smoother combat flow, especially during long grinding or PvE sessions.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 61 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 61 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyDown 34 1
Delay 15 ms
KeyUp 34 1
Delay 15 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rise Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>